title: "vscode-3d"
abstract: "Preview GLB and glTF models inside VS Code, try 2,800 library animations or a text-described motion on any rig and bake the result, generate and refine models from a prompt on the free three.ws lane, optimize for the web, diff a model against git, AI quality-check a render, and get diagnostics and completions for <agent-3d> embeds. Powered by three.ws."
